    "name": "The \"Real Sassy\" Creole Spice Blend",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">The spices are layered to give you a Haitian cuisine experience in your own kitchen.</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Boost the flavors in your plate with a little sprinkle! Sprinkle some on your regular toast or your sassy avocado toast! Mix some in with your eggs before frying them! Blend some in some olive oil, vinegar, and lime juice for an instant flavorful dressing! Blend some in some olive oil to marinate your steak! Have fun cooking with it!</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Ingredients: Onions, garlic, thyme, sage, white peppercorn, black peppercorn, Sea Salt, mustard, coriander, fennel seeds, smoked paprika, cayenne pepper, habanero pepper, chili flakes, chives, parsley flakes, dehydrated orange peel, cumin, turmeric, bay leaves</span></p>",
